"Hello again!\n\nYou did such an amazing job with my last commission that I really wanted to request you again.\n\nhttps://skeb.jp/@mI0I7/works/28\n\nI was wondering if you could do an art piece for my upcoming 2.0 model.\n\nShe is a Demon Cat Shrine Maiden who is cheeky and loves being mischievous.\n\nThe pose and expression are completely up to you!\n\nThank you for your consideration ~ <3\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FqryFExeURkqXl2zjn9f73rvpkd0jdJ4?usp=sharing", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mI0I7/works/41", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/26a564b1/uploads/origins/c0573fc0-6bb9-4d6c-a439-7bb0dc7aa4fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97420c3514e2d00261f49d144e2eafe6", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/26a564b1/uploads/origins/c0573fc0-6bb9-4d6c-a439-7bb0dc7aa4fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=97420c3514e2d00261f49d144e2eafe6, https://si.imgix.net/26a564b1/uploads/origins/c0573fc0-6bb9-4d6c-a439-7bb0dc7aa4fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c52eed9a325f1fb57b762409385b9023 2x, https://si.imgix.net/26a564b1/uploads/origins/c0573fc0-6bb9-4d6c-a439-7bb0dc7aa4fb?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=df1ffe02e5e206fc45c045a51a8774ed 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello again! I was hoping you could once again draw another vtuber friend of mine! Here is a link with references to her design: https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1LPh9jcCxBzRwsI9IMXsxiA-V1ywER6J1", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@mI0I7/works/40", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a65cc362/uploads/origins/d32be03d-5496-42d3-9c1e-b7be7c957f5d?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff19b47ed84bda32be471e9f0ee786e0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a65cc362/uploads/origins/d32be03d-5496-42d3-9c1e-b7be7c957f5d?bg=